    "Details": "The 9C variant was introduced during the Jihad and carried the least amount of weapons in comparison to the previous variants of the Ti Ts'ang. Aside from its Hatchet, the 'Mech has been fitted with a plasma rifle in the left arm which is supplied with 2 tons of ammo. For secondary weaponry, the 'mech has 2 ER Medium Lasers & ER Small Lasers scattered about its torso and head.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
